-- USPS Ground Advantage label price list, Tier 1-5 (THG Fulfillment, USD/label).
--
-- Source: Bang_gia_usps_ga_label.xlsx (sheets "Tier 1".."Tier 5", 24 weights x Zone 1-9).
-- The data below was generated from that file with parseUspsGaWorkbook(), not typed by hand;
-- src/features/pricing/migration0071.test.ts checks every cell against the fixture.
--
-- Inserted here because the CMS has no create path (same reason as 0042). Later price
-- changes go through the admin: Pricing -> "Tải bảng giá USPS GA (5 tier)".
--
-- Rows land as status = live because the CMS cannot change status and the landing
-- page shows a rate card only while it is live. Approving this PR approves the figures.
-- Tier 1 also becomes the 3PL domestic rate table on /domestic-pricing.
--
-- USD columns use semantic = "money_usd" + currency = "USD" deliberately (see 0042):
-- type = "currency" would resolve to integer VND and mangle $4.49.
--
-- Undo: DELETE FROM pricing_table_versions WHERE table_id IN (SELECT id FROM pricing_tables WHERE slug LIKE 'uspsGaLabelT%');
--       DELETE FROM pricing_tables WHERE slug LIKE 'uspsGaLabelT%';

